1
00:00:00,139 --> 00:00:01,569
(Leonard:)This is fun, huh?

2
00:00:01,573 --> 00:00:03,603
(Leonard:)We get to see our friend
throw out the first pitch,

3
00:00:03,609 --> 00:00:05,309
(Leonard:)have a hot dog,
watch the game.

4
00:00:05,311 --> 00:00:07,211
(Sheldon:)Whoa.

5
00:00:07,212 --> 00:00:09,342
(Sheldon:)Nobody said anything
about watching the game.

6
00:00:10,449 --> 00:00:12,749
(Amy:)Sheldon, what
did you expect?

7
00:00:12,751 --> 00:00:17,151
(Sheldon:)I expected to see Howard throw
the baseball, finish my hot dog,

8
00:00:17,156 --> 00:00:19,626
(Sheldon:)and hightail it across
the street to Disneyland

9
00:00:19,625 --> 00:00:22,925
(Sheldon:)just in time for Mickey's
Soundsational Parade.

10
00:00:22,928 --> 00:00:24,458
(Amy:)I'll tell you what.

11
00:00:24,463 --> 00:00:28,603
(Amy:)If we stay, I'll buy you
cotton candy and a bobblehead.

12
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,600
(Sheldon:)Who's the bobblehead of?

13
00:00:30,602 --> 00:00:32,072
(Amy:)Does it matter?

14
00:00:32,071 --> 00:00:34,801
(Sheldon:)No, as long as it bobbles.

15
00:00:36,342 --> 00:00:38,642
(Bernadette:)Howie, I am so proud of you.

16
00:00:38,644 --> 00:00:41,574
(Howard:)Thanks.
I'm proud of me, too.

17
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:42,650
Mm-hmm.

18
00:00:42,648 --> 00:00:44,448
(Man:)You ready?

19
00:00:44,450 --> 00:00:45,580
(Howard:)Let's do it.

20
00:00:45,584 --> 00:00:46,654
(Howard:)All right.

21
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:50,420
(Howard:)Wish me luck.

22
00:00:50,422 --> 00:00:51,792
(Bernadette:)Go get 'em.

23
00:00:51,790 --> 00:00:53,290
ANNOUNCER (over P.A.):
Ladies and gentlemen,

24
00:00:53,292 --> 00:00:55,992
in honor of Space Day at
Angel Stadium, the first pitch

25
00:00:55,995 --> 00:01:00,595
(Stadium Announcer:)will be thrown out by NASA
astronaut Howard Wolowitz.

